WEBVTT

00:24:59.301 --> 00:25:02.294
But the skeptical part of me is going,

00:25:02.318 --> 00:25:07.298
"Love the story, but you must
have friends in common,

00:25:07.322 --> 00:25:10.842
you talked to one of them and then
they accidentally talked to her.

00:25:10.866 --> 00:25:13.369
There was unconscious
transmission that way,

00:25:13.393 --> 00:25:16.533
or in one letter you might
have mentioned something ..."

00:25:16.557 --> 00:25:19.612
In technology, as I think you've
mentioned in one of your books,

00:25:19.636 --> 00:25:21.678
often things are invented
at the same time.

00:25:21.702 --> 00:25:25.476
There, there is a sort of
causal explanation for that,

00:25:25.500 --> 00:25:29.983
like certain tools come into existence,